  "bodyHash": "2ae7c0c92d9252b1",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/260/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"449\" height=\"449\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>這是一個資料包！</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jLOz8nt.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"></strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;Forge 模組請<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unwrecked-ships-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>取得</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bPe9GDA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\"></strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;Fabric 模組可於此處取得 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unwrecked-ships-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshop.purehosted.net%252faff%252fwabi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#808000;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12e69aa9dd8a00fb45de3a73c0452b2194e07eba.png\" alt=\"purehosted 伺服器 10% 優惠券，unwrecked ships 自訂橫幅\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"></span></a></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">您是否曾好奇過，原版《我的世界》中的<strong>沉船</strong>在完整狀態下會是什麼模樣？現在不用猜了，這個資料包修復了這些沉船並讓它們重新航行，自然生成於您的世界中！它們有一些小幅改動（例如添加了帆和燈籠），且僅保留原版設計風格。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s8fEtY6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Unwrecked Ships Base</strong></strong> 新增了 7 種船隻變體，<em>僅</em>使用原版可用的木材類型與組合，並僅搭配白色船帆。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PZ67H2c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;</span><strong>Unwrecked Ships Plus</strong></strong>&nbsp;新增了遊戲中<em>所有</em>木材類型與船帆顏色的組合，以及使用僅限下界木材的下界船隻。此外，部分船隻還會有船員，例如下界船隻會配備村民、掠奪者與豬布林。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">本資料包應能直接與大多數世界生成模組相容，但若發現任何不相容問題，請在「Issues」標籤頁中提交回報。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>圖庫：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/265/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"762\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/269/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"762\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/273/2022-12-04_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"758\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><strong>安裝方式：</strong></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><strong>此版本的 Unwrecked Ships 可作為資料包匯入至任何新世界中。</strong></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>下載 <strong>Unwrecked<strong>&nbsp;Ships</strong></strong>。</li>\n<li>開始建立新世界。選擇「資料包」選項。</li>\n<li>將 Unwrecked Ships 資料包拖曳至「可用」區塊，或者點擊「開啟資料包資料夾」並將資料包拖入該目錄。完成後按下「完成」。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">探索我們的其它資料包：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098920/description_0fb5046e-db7e-4520-a019-11a6b8af5fd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0a26ae\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Revamped Shipwrecks</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/pale-formations-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/5b1f4b7e261a4d31499986937acfcc660a8548cf.gif\" alt=\"Pale Formations 標誌\" width=\"187\" height=\"187\"></a><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><a style=\"color:#7e8c8d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/pale-formations-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pale Formations</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wabi-sabi-structures-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EiT59N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"116\"></a><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wabi-sabi-structures-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Wabi-Sabi Structures</span></span></a></span></strong></p>",
